# Expected snapshot of modal.html (plan 04 corpus). Lines must appear in
# this order and at this depth (other lines may come between); [ref]
# stands for any ref. A line starting with ! is text no line may contain.
# A modal dialog makes the rest of the page inert: it is left out.
- dialog "Settings"
  - heading "Settings" (h2)
  - form
    - textbox "Display name" [ref] value="Ada" focused
    - checkbox "Email me" [ref] checked
    - button "Cancel" [ref]
    - button "Save" [ref]
!Open settings
!Background text
!Cookie consent
!Home
